---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="The Real Story — Where Is Baldo?" description="Who is Ubaldo? Why 22 countries? Why can't he stop traveling? The actual story behind the blog.">
  <section style="text-align:center; padding: 6rem 2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="font-size: 4rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">🇲🇽</div>
    <span class="section-label">The Story</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem); margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;">Still Writing This One</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--brown); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      This is the long version of who I am and why I do this. It's actually a good read — but I'm still in the middle of writing it. Turns out telling your life story takes longer when you actually care about getting it right.
    </p>
    <p style="color: var(--brown); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      For now, check out my posts. You'll figure out who I am pretty quick.
    </p>
    <a href="/blog" class="btn-primary">Read the Blog</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
